            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Is the Life Fitness Platinum Club Series worth the price?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              It is no longer sold new: Life Fitness lists it as discontinued and names the Club Series+ as its replacement. On Life Fitness's own figures the Club Series+ has the same 4.0 HP AC motor, 22 x 60-inch running surface, 0.5 to 12 mph speed range and 400 lb rating, at $7,599 with the SL console or $10,999 with the SE4 on October 20, 2026. A used Platinum Club Series is worth it only at a clear discount to that, after checking its console and condition.
