              Life Fitness lists the Platinum Club Series with a 4.0 HP (8.0 HP peak) AC motor, a 22 x 60-inch running surface and a 400 lb user rating; our T3 review lists a 3.0 CHP motor and a 20 x 60-inch deck, so the belts are the same length and the Platinum Club Series is two inches wider. It was also sold with larger Discover touchscreen consoles. Both are fixed-frame machines that do not fold, and the Platinum Club Series is now discontinued.
